:''For the enemy, see [[Malevolent Jamiera Cat]].''
'''Brainwashed Titan Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Xmas Gals (Gacha Event)|Xmas Gals]], [[White Day Capsules (Gacha Event)|White Day Capsules]], [[Gals of Summer Blue Ocean (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Blue Ocean]] and [[Miracle 4 Selection (Gacha Event)|Miracle 4 Selection]] events. It was added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]]. This unit is a [[:Category:Brainwashed Cats|Brainwashed]] variant of [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]] gains immunity to [[Knockback]], [[Slow]], [[Weaken]] and [[Surge Attack|Surge]].

