==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Brainwashed Mythic Titan''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Brainwashed Jamiera Cat''' after obtaining from [[Titanic Rampage (Merciless)]] and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
Brainwashed Titan Cat does powerful Area Attacks at close range, with a 20% chance for a [[Savage Blow]]. Since the Savage Blow only triples its damage and is inconsistent, it should not be relied upon.

This unit shares the same flaws as the [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Normal]] and [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Titans]], as it simply lacks the stats and range to be of any use. Many enemies can simply outrange and quickly defeat it with their extreme DPS, completely denying their impact in action.

Usage of Brainwashed Titan Cat isn't nonexistent, though, as it can be used alongside Titan Cat and Crazed Titan Cat for tanking and chipping at weaker bosses, such as the [[Camelle]] in [[The Infected King]], or against [[Daboo of the Dead]].

==='''True Form'''===
Brainwashed Jamiera Cat gains Immunity to Surge, Weaken, Knockback and Slow. Although these are far from perfect and most [[:Category:Enemies with Freeze ability|Freeze-based threats]] still easily disable it, they do allow the unit to be more consistent against targets that employ such abilities and continue to unleash unreliable Savage Blows. Otherwise, the lack of meaningful bonuses, such as stats and other abilities, means it remains outclassed as Savage Blow is too inconsistent for it to be of much use, even if it delivers successful hits and can potentially do more than [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Jamiera Cat]].

